A||N||5||Kelvin Vivian||Removing Wheel Lock Stud||||1||
Z||000000||Kelvin Vivian||02-14-2001||05:28 AM||||What are some of the ways of removing wheel lock studs without its connector. I saw an 87 GT in a wrecker yard and I wanted the rims, but I couldn't get the wheel lock stud loose...<P>Thanks,<BR>Kelvin||||reg||1
Z||000001||Haze_Performance||02-14-2001||06:13 AM||||Well if you have an old long drive socket you wont miss.... It has to be slightly smaller than the nut size. You then just beat it on untill its nice & tight. Then use a ratchet to unscrew it. <P>Thats how I removed a set of lock nuts off a Mustang I had. Even after all that the socket was still good.<P>Good Luck  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <P> <P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttttttt.gif"> </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>PFF Members Photo Page</A><BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1431213" TARGET=_blank><BR>Photopoint Gallery</A>||||reg||10
Z||000002||RossT||02-14-2001||06:16 AM||||Use craftsman, then take it back to sears and get a new socket (free) after your done.||||reg||1
Z||000003||ThatRickGuy||02-14-2001||09:05 AM||||Aggree w/ Ross. I pulled out an old set of junk sockets I a long time ago and just hammered on on there... works, just don't count on using it much.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000004||rogergarrison||02-14-2001||12:13 PM||||they do make a special socket like an EZ Out with teeth. you hammer it on then use lug wrench. May be able to borrow one from any big tire/wheel installer if you know them.||||reg||1
Z||000005||TheFiero64||02-14-2001||04:08 PM||||I went to Pontiac to have mine removed. When I got my car it didn't come with the tool. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>It cost me ten bucks.<P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>88 Coupe V6<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TheFiero64_signature1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||1
